  "description": {
   "en": "Kongming vs Helen Keller!? A Mahjong War of Great Men!\n\nGreat men with overwhelming \"power of destiny\" compete for the title of \"God of the Next Generation\" in a mahjong match!\nThe first match is between Zhuge Liang Kongming vs Newton vs Katsushika Hokusai vs Helen Keller! Don't miss this authentic mahjong match where the \"abilities\" and \"power of destiny\" of great men collide!\nBeautiful artist Yamada Shutaro passionately draws the psychological battle drawn by Kawamoto Homura, the original author of \"Kakegurui\"! Under the supervision of Mizuguchi Mika of the Japan Professional Mahjong Association, the strongest mahjong manga of the Reiwa era is born!"
  },
